{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18201240","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18201240","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1820124001:1":{"text":"Wow! Look at all these beautiful handicrafts!","source_cn":"哇，好多漂亮的工艺品！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC101A67B53A0CC7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1820124002:1":{"text":"I knew they'd be right up your alley!","source_cn":"是吧？我就知道你会喜欢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A39568452144B98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1820124003:1":{"text":"Most Graveborn pass the time by devoting themselves to a craft.","source_cn":"为了消磨漫长的生命，大部分亡灵都会认真钻研一件事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC461A1F5F9945DAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1820124004:1":{"text":"Ever heard of the famous ten-thousand-hour rule? That's supposedly how long it takes to master a skill.","source_cn":"你们学校以前不是总喜欢说一句什么话吗？“给我一万个小时...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6F53132B679138A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1820124005:1":{"text":"The good thing is, time is never a problem for us Graveborn. We've got all the time in the world to hone our skills.","source_cn":"成为亡灵的好处，就在于你有几乎数不尽的时间，足以将技艺...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8D2E33415DFC310","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1820124006:1":{"text":"That's what makes Novaris home to countless extraordinary works of art!","source_cn":"所以，诺珐斯其实有很多绝世罕见的艺术品哦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7ACA544D7C7B5456","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1820124007:1":{"text":"I see... I'll make sure I get a good look at everything!","source_cn":"哇……那我一定要仔细欣赏一下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AC88EFD44F23FA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1820124008:1":{"text":"Go ahead, my darling.","source_cn":"去吧，我亲爱的小薇薇娅。我们还有很多、很多的时间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53F5486B005D0D2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:10:1820124009:0":{"text":"Vivi bends down at a stall, scrutinizing every piece on display...","source_cn":"薇薇娅俯下身，聚精会神地挨个端详着摊位上的工艺品……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A1D74F119E272D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1820124010:1":{"text":"... This sculpture is incredible... And that candelabra has such a unique design...","source_cn":"……这个雕塑好精致，那个烛台造型也很有设计感……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7637385C256F7E1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1820124011:1":{"text":"... But this tea set is my favorite!","source_cn":"……不过，还是这套茶具最好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05018B70BD545073","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:12::2":{"text":"Fine Tea Set","source_cn":"精美的茶具","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x142D0FBF94239ADA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1820124012:1":{"text":"Such exquisite craftsmanship, such delicate finish... It's almost too beautiful to use for tea!","source_cn":"做工精美、烧制细腻……我都要舍不得用它喝茶了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBE09E347B09E1A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1820124013:1":{"text":"Wow... same thought here! That's one stunning tea set.","source_cn":"哦！这套茶具的确很好看，我还没见过这么精致的茶壶呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B4261B71AF86109","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1820124014:1":{"text":"Excellent choice! This tea set is one of my proudest works.","source_cn":"客人的眼光很好。这也是我的得意之作。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF687A7A0B4EB6AEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1820124015:1":{"text":"I went through hundreds of revisions to get the design just right!","source_cn":"死后，多得是时间来打磨商品。你眼前的这套茶具，是我足足...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F4A3B510CCF079D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1820124016:1":{"text":"If you'd prefer a different design, I also take custom orders.","source_cn":"当然，如果你对款式不满意，想要别的样式，我也接定制的单子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1AF254CC3102E56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1820124017:1":{"text":"That said, I'm already booked for the next 178 years. You'll have to wait just a little while.","source_cn":"不过，目前订单排到了178年后。需要再等上一小段时间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF389B07816EABA3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1820124018:1":{"text":"A... little while?","source_cn":"一……一小段……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x018259F919FD67C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1820124019:1":{"text":"Let me think about it...","source_cn":"让我想想……<key:dialog898>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F86F19AF219CC11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:薇薇娅":{"text":"Vivi","source":"薇薇娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莎柏琳":{"text":"Sabrine","source":"莎柏琳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"Subtitles","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:摊主冥妮莎":{"text":"Owner Mournia","source":"摊主冥妮莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":21,"localized_text_count":20,"speaker_count":4}}